{329}{Thanks for asking.  Magickal forces affect the proper function of mechanical devices.  Complex machinery, like our train locomotive, may fail to operate in the presence of Magick.  In the case of a train, it could be disastrous!}{Thanks for asking.  Magickal forces affect the proper function of mechanical devices.  Complex machinery, like our train locomotive, may fail to operate in the presence of Magick.  In the case of a train, it could be disastrous!}{}{}{}{}
{330}{Yes.}{}{5}{}{332}{}
{331}{Tell me more.}{}{5}{}{332}{}
{332}{Therefore, all passengers are questioned to determine their magickal nature.  Those that are very magickal must sit in the back of the train, as far as possible from the locomotive, to minimize the risk of an accident.  The last car on a train is called the caboose, so this car is called the Mage's Caboose.}{Therefore, all passengers are questioned to determine their magickal nature.  Those that are very magickal must sit in the back of the train, as far as possible from the locomotive, to minimize the risk of an accident.  The last car on a train is called the caboose, so this car is called the Mage's Caboose.}{}{}{}{}
